      "writtenOn": "2024-02-06T19:40:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am not sure if I understood your question correctly.\n\nThe `ArcType` is defined only if an Arc encrypts another Arc (i.e. the payload of the outer Arc is another Arc). So far, we have identified two types of such arcs created in the auth-bound key management flow, which are defined here. If we encounter more, we can add them here.",
